---
// src/components/CalculadoraTablerosEn.astro
// Electrical Protection Sizing and Panel Design Calculator - Theme Amber/Yellow (#FF9100)
---
<section class="section section-alt" id="calc-tableros-en">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal" style="margin: 0 auto 50px auto; text-align: center;">
      <span class="section-subtitle" style="color: #FF9100;">Electromechanical Engineering</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Electrical Panel Design & Protection Calculator</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Sizing and design for electrical panels (Main and Distribution). Determine circuit quantity, size miniature circuit breakers (MCBs), residual current devices (RCDs), cable sections, distribution terminal blocks, and load balancing according to AEA / IEC regulations.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="calculator-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; align-items: start;">
      <!-- SECTION 1: INPUT FORM -->
      <div class="card reveal" style="border-top: 4px solid #FF9100; padding: 25px;">
        <h3 style="color: #FF9100; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.15); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 1.3rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
          <span>⚡</span> Supply and Load Parameters
        </h3>

        <div class="form-group-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 600;">System Type (Phases)</label>
            <select id="tab-red-en" class="calc-select" style="border-color: #FF9100; width: 100%; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
              <option value="monofasica" selected>Single-phase (220V)</option>
              <option value="trifasica">Three-phase (380V)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 600;">Protection Brand</label>
            <select id="tab-marca-en" class="calc-select" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
              <option value="schneider" selected>Schneider Electric (Acti9 / Easy9)</option>
              <option value="siemens">Siemens (Sentron 5SY / 5SL)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 600;">Simultaneity Factor (Fs)</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-simultaneidad-en" class="calc-input" value="0.8" min="0.4" max="1.0" step="0.05" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;" />
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Factor to estimate simultaneous demand in the building.</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CATEGORY: GENERAL PURPOSE -->
        <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.05rem; border-left: 3px solid #FF9100; padding-left: 8px;">1. General Purpose Circuits (GP Sockets / GP Lighting)</h4>
        <div class="form-group-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Qty of 10A Sockets (General Purpose)</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-bocas-tug-en" class="calc-input" value="12" min="0" step="1" style="width: 100%;" />
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Max 15 sockets per circuit. Estimated load: 2200VA each circuit.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Qty of Standard LED Lighting Fixtures</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-bocas-iug-en" class="calc-input" value="15" min="0" step="1" style="width: 100%;" />
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Max 15 fixtures per circuit. Estimated load: 1500VA each circuit.</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CATEGORY: SPECIAL PURPOSE -->
        <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.05rem; border-left: 3px solid #FF9100; padding-left: 8px;">2. Special Purpose Circuits (SP Sockets / SP Lighting)</h4>
        <div class="form-group-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Qty of 20A Sockets / Special Loads</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-bocas-tue-en" class="calc-input" value="3" min="0" step="1" style="width: 100%;" />
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">For ovens, pumps, etc. Estimated load: 3300VA per circuit (max 12 sockets).</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Qty of Outdoor Floodlights / Special Lighting</label>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
              <input type="number" id="tab-bocas-iue-en" class="calc-input" value="0" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Qty." style="flex: 1;" />
              <input type="number" id="tab-w-iue-en" class="calc-input" value="150" min="20" step="50" placeholder="Watts each" style="flex: 1;" />
            </div>
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">LED project floodlights for yards, warehouses, etc.</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CATEGORY: MOTORS & ELEVATION -->
        <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.05rem; border-left: 3px solid #FF9100; padding-left: 8px;">3. Motor Power & Lift Equipment</h4>
        <div class="form-group-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Single-phase Motors (Water Pumps, Compressors)</label>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
              <input type="number" id="tab-motores-mono-en" class="calc-input" value="1" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Qty." style="flex: 1;" />
              <select id="tab-hp-mono-en" class="calc-select" style="flex: 1.5;">
                <option value="0.5">0.5 HP (373W)</option>
                <option value="0.75">0.75 HP (560W)</option>
                <option value="1" selected>1.0 HP (746W)</option>
                <option value="1.5">1.5 HP (1119W)</option>
                <option value="2">2.0 HP (1492W)</option>
                <option value="3">3.0 HP (2238W)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Direct starting (curve D) and exclusive dedicated circuit.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Three-phase Motors (Three-phase supply only)</label>
            <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
              <input type="number" id="tab-motores-tri-en" class="calc-input" value="0" min="0" step="1" placeholder="Qty." style="flex: 1;" />
              <select id="tab-hp-tri-en" class="calc-select" style="flex: 1.5;">
                <option value="1">1.0 HP (746W)</option>
                <option value="2" selected>2.0 HP (1492W)</option>
                <option value="3">3.0 HP (2238W)</option>
                <option value="5">5.0 HP (3730W)</option>
                <option value="7.5">7.5 HP (5595W)</option>
                <option value="10">10.0 HP (7460W)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Disabled in single-phase. Curve D circuit breaker.</small>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Lifts / Elevators (Machine Room)</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-ascensores-en" class="calc-input" value="0" min="0" step="1" style="width: 100%;" />
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Assumes standard 7.5 HP three-phase units.</small>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CATEGORY: AC UNITS -->
        <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.05rem; border-left: 3px solid #FF9100; padding-left: 8px;">4. Large Scale Air Conditioning (Rooftop, VRV, Ducted)</h4>
        <div class="form-group-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Qty of A/C Units</label>
            <input type="number" id="tab-ac-cant-en" class="calc-input" value="1" min="0" step="1" style="width: 100%;" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label style="display: block; margin-bottom: 6px;">Capacity per Unit (Frigorías / BTU)</label>
            <select id="tab-ac-frigorias-en" class="calc-select" style="width: 100%; padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px;">
              <option value="3000">3000 Frigorías (~12k BTU, Cons. ~1.1 kW)</option>
              <option value="4500">4500 Frigorías (~18k BTU, Cons. ~1.6 kW)</option>
              <option value="6000">6000 Frigorías (~24k BTU, Cons. ~2.2 kW)</option>
              <option value="9000" selected>9000 Frigorías (~36k BTU, Cons. ~3.3 kW) - Three-phase opt.</option>
              <option value="15000">15000 Frigorías (~60k BTU, Cons. ~5.5 kW) - Three-phase rec.</option>
              <option value="20000">20000 Frigorías (~80k BTU, Cons. ~7.3 kW) - Three-phase req.</option>
            </select>
            <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.72rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;">Calculated using average COP of 3.2.</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- SECTION 2: RESULTS INTERFACE & DIAGRAMS -->
      <div class="card reveal" style="border-top: 4px solid #FF9100; padding: 25px; transition-delay: 0.1s;">
        <!-- TABS -->
        <div class="tab-buttons" style="display: flex; gap: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap;">
          <button type="button" class="tab-btn-en active" data-tab="tab-riel-din-en" style="background: rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.1); color: #FF9100; border: 1px solid #FF9100; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">
            🎛️ DIN Rail Layout
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-btn-en" data-tab="tab-planilla-en" style="background: transparent; color: var(--text-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">
            📋 Circuit Schedule
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-btn-en" id="btn-tab-balanceo-en" data-tab="tab-balanceo-en" style="background: transparent; color: var(--text-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; display: none;">
            ⚖️ Phase Balancing
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="tab-btn-en" data-tab="tab-consejos-en" style="background: transparent; color: var(--text-secondary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">
            💡 Sizing & Optimization
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT 1: DIN RAIL -->
        <div id="tab-riel-din-en" class="tab-content-en">
          <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; padding: 15px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem;">
              Schematic representation of the Main Distribution Panel's <strong>DIN Rail</strong>. Sizing assumes modular enclosure placement.
            </p>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.85rem;">
              <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background: #d32f2f; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span> MCB (Incomer / Breaker)</span>
              <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background: #1976d2; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span> RCD (Differential / RCCB)</span>
              <span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px;"><span style="width: 15px; height: 15px; background: #388e3c; border-radius: 3px; display: inline-block;"></span> Surge Protective Device (SPD)</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- THE DIN RAIL -->
          <div style="position: relative; padding: 25px 15px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #333 0%, #1a1a1a 100%); border-radius: 12px; border: 4px solid #444; box-shadow: inset 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); margin-bottom: 20px; overflow-x: auto;">
            <div style="position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: 50%; height: 35px; transform: translateY(-50%); background: linear-gradient(180deg, #777 0%, #999 40%, #555 70%, #888 100%); border-top: 1px solid #aaa; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; z-index: 1;"></div>
            <div id="riel-din-contenedor-en" style="position: relative; display: flex; gap: 6px; z-index: 2; align-items: flex-end; min-width: 600px;">
              <!-- Loaded dynamically -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="result-summary-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">DIN Modules Occupied:</span>
              <strong id="tab-res-modulos-en" style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: #FF9100;">0</strong>
              <small style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.7rem; display: block; margin-top: 2px;">1 module = 18 mm.</small>
            </div>
            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">Suggested Enclosure Size:</span>
              <strong id="tab-res-gabinete-en" style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--text-primary);">0 Ways</strong>
              <small id="tab-res-reserva-en" style="color: #8CC63F; font-size: 0.7rem; display: block; margin-top: 2px;">+20% spare capacity.</small>
            </div>
            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; text-align: center;">
              <span style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); display: block;">Simultaneous Demand (MDSP):</span>
              <strong id="tab-res-dmps-en" style="font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--text-primary);">0.0 kW</strong>
              <small id="tab-res-amperes-en" style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.7rem; display: block; margin-top: 2px;">0.0 A per phase.</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT 2: CIRCUIT SCHEDULE -->
        <div id="tab-planilla-en" class="tab-content-en" style="display: none;">
          <div style="overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);">
            <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; min-width: 800px; text-align: left; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-primary);">
              <thead>
                <tr style="background: rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.08); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 145, 0, 0.25);">
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700;">Circuit No.</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700;">Type / Destination</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Sockets / Points</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Power (VA)</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Current Ib (A)</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Cable Size (mm²)</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">MCB Rating (In)</th>
                  <th style="padding: 12px 10px; color: #FF9100; font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Phase</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="tab-planilla-tbody-en">
                <!-- Loaded dynamically -->
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT 3: PHASE BALANCING -->
        <div id="tab-balanceo-en" class="tab-content-en" style="display: none;">
          <h4 style="color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 1.1rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
            <span>⚖️</span> Three-phase Balancing Diagnostics
          </h4>
          <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 20px;">
            In three-phase systems, balancing active loads in Watts and Amperes across all three phases (R, S, T) is crucial to minimize neutral currents, avoid voltage drops, and prevent utility penalties.
          </p>

          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
            <!-- PHASE R -->
            <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-top: 3px solid #ff4444; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #ff4444; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;">PHASE R (L1)</h5>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Power: <strong id="balance-w-r-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0 W</strong></p>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Current: <strong id="balance-a-r-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0.0 A</strong></p>
              <div style="width: 100%; height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
                <div id="balance-bar-r-en" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: #ff4444; transition: width 0.4s;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- PHASE S -->
            <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-top: 3px solid #ffcc00; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #ffcc00; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;">PHASE S (L2)</h5>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Power: <strong id="balance-w-s-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0 W</strong></p>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Current: <strong id="balance-a-s-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0.0 A</strong></p>
              <div style="width: 100%; height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
                <div id="balance-bar-s-en" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: #ffcc00; transition: width 0.4s;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- PHASE T -->
            <div style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-top: 3px solid #33b5e5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #33b5e5; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;">PHASE T (L3)</h5>
              <p style="margin: 0 0 6px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Power: <strong id="balance-w-t-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0 W</strong></p>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.82rem;">Current: <strong id="balance-a-t-en" style="color: var(--text-primary);">0.0 A</strong></p>
              <div style="width: 100%; height: 8px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
                <div id="balance-bar-t-en" style="height: 100%; width: 0%; background: #33b5e5; transition: width 0.4s;"></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="balanceo-diagnostic-alert-en" style="padding: 12px 15px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; border-left: 4px solid #8CC63F; background: rgba(140, 198, 99, 0.08); color: var(--text-primary);">
            <!-- Loaded dynamically -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- TAB CONTENT 4: RECOMMENDATIONS -->
        <div id="tab-consejos-en" class="tab-content-en" style="display: none;">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 15px;">
            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #FF9100; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>🔗</span> Sub-distribution Boards (DB / Subpanels)
              </h5>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">
                If loads are located more than <strong>15-20 meters</strong> away (yards, workshops, elevator machine rooms, upper floors), it is highly recommended to place a <strong>Sub-distribution Board (DB)</strong> in that sector. This reduces multiple long cable runs and facilitates easy operation and isolation during servicing.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #FF9100; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>🔌</span> Distribution Blocks (Busbars / Terminals)
              </h5>
              <p id="tab-res-borneras-en" style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">
                Loading recommendations...
              </p>
            </div>

            <div style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px;">
              <h5 style="color: #FF9100; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0 0 8px 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;">
                <span>🛡️</span> Protection Coordination & Grounding
              </h5>
              <p style="font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.4;">
                Ensure that MCB ratings always protect the cable ($I_n \le I_z$). All circuits must carry a yellow-green protective earth (PE) wire connected to a ground rod (jabalina) with an electrical resistance under <strong>10 Ohms</strong>. RCDs should be tested monthly using the test button (T).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ACTIONS -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 25px;">
